# Kubernetes observability architecture

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Browser[Local browser]
  subgraph EC2[AWS EC2 Ubuntu]
    Docker[Docker Engine]
    subgraph Cluster[Kind: observability]
      Workload[Sample and test pods]
      KSM[kube-state-metrics]
      Prom[Prometheus]
      Grafana[Grafana dashboard and alert]
      AM[Alertmanager]
      Workload -->|Kubernetes object metrics| KSM
      KSM -->|scrape| Prom
      Prom -->|PromQL queries| Grafana
      Prom -->|Prometheus alerts| AM
    end
    Docker --> Cluster
  end
  Browser -->|SSH tunnel and port-forward| Grafana
```

This architecture reflects the completed Kind-on-EC2 lab. It is not an EKS design. Alertmanager is installed as part of the chart; the custom Grafana alert was evaluated in Grafana and external delivery was not configured.
